(KEY-27 — `Send signal` is a statement performing `kill(2)`, and `child`
 is accepted as an alias for `process`.
 Ran: VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox KEY-27.vox -o p && ./p
 expected output:
   signal 0 delivered
   signal 9 delivered
   signal to a stranger set the error flag
)
Set pid to fork the process.
If pid is 0 then,
    Wait 5000 milliseconds,
    Exit 0.
Send signal 0 to process pid.
On error print "signal 0 to a live child failed".
Print "signal 0 delivered".
Send signal 9 to child pid.
On error print "signal 9 failed".
Print "signal 9 delivered".
Set reaped to reap child pid.
Send signal 9 to process 999999.
On error print "signal to a stranger set the error flag".
